    "description": "Family of digital indicating devices designated the CI-600 Series (CI-601A, CI-605A or CI-607A) which, connected to a weighing platform, form a single or dual-interval, Class III or IIII, non-automatic weighing instrument. The instruments are not designed for direct sales to the public. D-variants are designed for connection to a digital load cell. Plastic enclosure, 4.3\" LCD display, operator keypad; interfaces include load cell connection and RS232/485; optional Relay In/Out and Analogue Out cards. Software held in firmware with identification number V1.xx; sealing by tamper-evident method covering electronics, configuration switch and load cell connection."
